/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 152 0 R
/T (A European material handling manufacturer wanted to enter three African markets. Instead of relying on GDP reports, we ran a structured outbound demand test across 450 accounts \(150 per market\). The results were highly revealing: Nigeria yielded 21 qualified opportunities \(buyers with confirmed need within 6 months\), Kenya yielded 9, and South Africa yielded only 4. The data allowed the board to deprioritize South Africa and approve a targeted entry into Nigeria, saving an estimated $150,000 in wasted market-entry costs.)
/E (A European material handling manufacturer wanted to enter three African markets. Instead of relying on GDP reports, we ran a structured outbound demand test across 450 accounts \(150 per market\). The results were highly revealing: Nigeria yielded 21 qualified opportunities \(buyers with confirmed need within 6 months\), Kenya yielded 9, and South Africa yielded only 4. The data allowed the board to deprioritize South Africa and approve a targeted entry into Nigeria, saving an estimated $150,000 in wasted market-entry costs.)
