/Title (A country may urgently need modern agricultural machinery, HVAC systems, or industrial processing equipment. Yet the organisations that need that equipment may lack financing, operate under constrained budgets, or be unable to justify the initial capital expenditure. Other buyers may be purchasing, but from competitors offering more accessible financing or lower total ownership costs.)
