/Title (A European material handling manufacturer wanted to enter three African markets. Instead of relying on GDP reports, we ran a structured outbound demand test across 450 accounts \(150 per market\). The results were highly revealing: Nigeria yielded 21 qualified opportunities \(buyers with confirmed need within 6 months\), Kenya yielded 9, and South Africa yielded only 4. The data allowed the board to deprioritize South Africa and approve a targeted entry into Nigeria, saving an estimated $150,000 in wasted market-entry costs.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1359 0 R
/Prev 1451 0 R
>>
endobj
