<<
/Title (An HVAC manufacturer was approached by three Nigerian distributors claiming established networks. We conducted structured reference checks on each. Distributor A \(the most impressive presenter\) could only prove 4 of 12 referenced customers were actively purchasing. Distributor B confirmed 9 of 10. Distributor C had zero verifiable field sales activity. We eliminated A and C, saving the client from locking their brand into a stagnant channel for years.)
