/Title (An agricultural machinery manufacturer sold a fleet of tractors in Tanzania through a distributor with no service infrastructure. When harvest season hit and machines broke down, the farm waited 12 days for parts. They lost thousands in revenue. We stepped in to build a localized service network, contracting two local technical providers and placing consignment stock. Downtime dropped by 45%, and the distributor successfully closed 3 delayed repeat orders.)
