/Title (A packaging machinery manufacturer had a Nigerian distributor for two years with flat sales. The distributor claimed "national coverage." When we deployed our field sales tracking system \(Factory 23\) and mapped the actual addressable market, we found the distributor had only visited 18% of the target accounts. Their entire sales pipeline was tracked in personal WhatsApp messages and notebooks. Once we assigned territories and implemented lead logging, the pipeline tripled within six months.)
